or separate accounting system.

Manual Entry must feed normalized executions into the existing trading
architecture.

Protected infrastructure was NOT rewritten today:

- Existing broker sync
- Existing execution ledger architecture
- Existing FIFO reconstruction
- Existing reconstructed trades
- Existing reconciliation
- Existing P&L engine
- Existing analytics
- Dashboard V2
